    "cons": [
      "No wheels, so you carry or push its full weight",
      "EGO's three-car driveway claim is a light-snow best case",
      "List price is high if you need the kit with battery"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The EGO 56V 12-inch shovel is the best all-rounder: light for its power, aimable, and the obvious buy for anyone already on EGO batteries."
  },
  {
    "id": "toro-60v-power-shovel-39909",
    "name": "Toro 60V MAX 12-Inch Power Shovel (39909)",
