            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What is the best cordless snow shovel for seniors?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Look for the lightest tool you can find, and wheels if you have a long walk. The Snow Joe 24V-SS13-XR is the lightest complete kit here at a listed 13.5 to 14 pounds, and Ryobi's 40V wheeled shovel lets you push rather than carry. Anyone with heart or back concerns should check with a doctor first.
